9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11015","name":{"zh":"再出岐山","en":"Return to Qishan"},"year":"231","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,30,75,76,83,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,30,75,76,83,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,30,75,76,83,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1047","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[36,30,75,76,83,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1001","noRecruit":true,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[36,30,75,76,83,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉末年著名的医学家，因所著《伤寒杂病论》奠定了中医临床诊疗的理论体系。字仲景，后世多称其字。出身南阳大族，少时便对医学产生兴趣，曾拜访名士何颙，何颙预言其日后必为名医。汉灵帝时，被举为孝廉，后出任长沙太守。在长沙任上，体察民情，留心疾病，常于公堂为百姓诊治，由此留下“坐堂行医”的典故。约于建安二十四年病逝；晋代王叔和整理其遗作，得以流传后世。后世尊为医圣，与华佗、董奉合称建安三神医。","tc":"東漢末年著名的醫學家，因所著《傷寒雜病論》奠定了中醫臨床診療的理論體系。字仲景，后世多稱其字。出身南陽大族，少時便對醫學產生興趣，曾拜訪名士何颙，何颙預言其日后必為名醫。漢靈帝時，被舉為孝廉，后出任長沙太守。在長沙任上，體察民情，留心疾病，常于公堂為百姓診治，由此留下“坐堂行醫”的典故。約于建安二十四年病逝；晉代王叔和整理其遺作，得以流傳后世。后世尊為醫圣，與華佗、董奉合稱建安三神醫。","en":"A renowned physician of the late Eastern Han Dynasty whose work Treatise on Cold Damage and Miscellaneous Diseases laid the theoretical foundation for clinical Chinese medicine. His courtesy name was Zhongjing, by which later generations mostly referred to him. Born into a prominent clan of Nanyang, he showed a keen interest in Medicine from a young age. He once visited the renowned scholar He Yong, who predicted that he would become a master physician. During Emperor Ling's reign, he was nominated as Filial and Incorrupt, and later served as Governor of Changsha. While in Changsha, he showed great empathy for the common folk, paid close attention to illnesses, and often held consultations in the government hall to treat the people—giving rise to the phrase 'practicing medicine in the hall'. He died of illness around the 24th year of Jian'an. In the Jin Dynasty, Wang Shuhe compiled his surviving manuscripts, ensuring their transmission to posterity. Later generations revered him as the 'Sage of Medicine', and he, Hua Tuo, and Dong Feng are collectively celebrated as the Three Divine Physicians of Jian'an.","jp":"後漢末期の著名な医学者。著述した『傷寒雑病論』によって中医学の臨床診療における理論体系の基礎を築いた。字は仲景で、後世にはその字で広く知られる。南陽の大族の出身。幼少より医学に関心を持ち、名士の何顒を訪ねた際には、将来必ずや名医になると予言された。後漢の霊帝の代に孝廉に推挙され、のちに長沙太守に就任した。長沙の任地においては民情を察して疾病に心を配り、しばしば公堂にて庶民の診察と治療を行ったことから、「坐堂行医」の故事を残した。建安二十四年頃に病没。晋代に王叔和がその遺作を整理・編纂したことで、後世へと伝えられた。後世からは「医聖」と尊崇され、華佗、董奉とともに「建安の三神医」と称される。","kr":"동한 말기의 저명한 의학자로, 저서인 《상한잡병론》을 통해 중의학 임상 진료의 이론적 체계를 확립했다. 자는 중경(仲景)이며, 후세에는 주로 자로 불렸다. 남양의 대족 출신으로 어려서부터 의학에 관심을 두었고, 일찍이 명사 하옹을 찾아갔을 때 훗날 반드시 명의가 될 것이라는 예언을 들었다. 한 영제 시기 효렴으로 천거되었으며 이후 장사태수를 역임했다. 장사태수 재임 시절 민정을 살피고 질병에 마음을 기울였으며, 늘 관청 공당에서 백성들을 진료하여 이로부터 '좌당행의(坐堂行医)'라는 고사를 남겼다. 건안 24년경 병으로 세상을 떠났으나, 진나라의 왕숙화가 유작을 정리하여 후세에 전해질 수 있었다. 후세에 의성(醫聖)으로 추앙받았으며, 화타, 동봉과 함께 건안삼신의(建安三神醫)로 불린다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1029515","remark":"","surname":"张","surnameTc":"張","surnameEn":"Zhang","surnameJp":"張","surnameKr":"장","surnameOther":"","name":"机","nameTc":"機","nameEn":"Ji","nameJp":"機","nameKr":"기","nameOther":"","word":"仲景","wordTc":"仲景","wordEn":"Zhongjing","wordJp":"仲景","wordKr":"중경","wordOther":"","icon":"张机","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"0","travel":"1","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1047","gender":"0","rule":"36","force":"30","wise":"75","politics":"76","charm":"83","will":"86","ruleTalent":"1","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"8","willTalent":"9","weaponMaster":"11/11/11/11/11/82/34/11","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1004105;1004205;1004305","debateCard":"1001602","warSoul":"S1000402","battleSoul":"1003805","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6000","battleSoulPoint":"1400","debateSoulPoint":"6600","strategy":"1001405","strategy2":"1007501;1006501","professions":"0/0/0/0/0/0/0/1/2/0/2/0/0/4/0/3/1/1/2/5/6/0/5/5","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"6","compatible":"0","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","evaluate":"18000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"150","show":"184","death":"219","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"0","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"1","weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014805","helmet":"","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"21/1;27/1;41/1;59/1;31/1;45/2;12/1;23/1;70/0;8/0;20/0;38/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"WJ10912/6;WJ10382/6","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"东汉末年著名的医学家，因所著《伤寒杂病论》奠定了中医临床诊疗的理论体系。字仲景，后世多称其字。出身南阳大族，少时便对医学产生兴